title: "Machine Learning Reference: equations and loss functions for common models"
abstract: >-
  A compact reference of the core equations and loss functions behind common
  machine learning models, spanning supervised and unsupervised learning, deep
  learning and reinforcement learning, together with a practical guide to
  building applications with LangChain.
